admin-logs-export-button = Download entire round
admin-logs-export-cancel = Cancel export
admin-logs-export-confirm = Confirm
admin-logs-export-open-folder = Open folder
admin-logs-export-confirm-1 = Are you sure you want to download all administrative logs for the selected round?
admin-logs-export-confirm-2 = Are you absolutely sure? The export may be large and contain sensitive information about players.
admin-logs-export-confirm-3 = Final confirmation: all logs for the selected round will be transferred to your computer. The export and the reported local save result will be audited. Store the file securely and do not share it with unauthorized people.
admin-logs-export-confirm-scope = Round #{ $round }: ALL event types, players and times, regardless of table filters. An ongoing round is captured at the start of the export. The format is UTF-8 JSONL with a header and completion record. The complete file is saved in the local exports folder, which you can open afterwards. Existing files are never overwritten.
admin-logs-export-ready = Export is available to administrators with log access.
admin-logs-export-awaiting-confirmation = Awaiting confirmation
admin-logs-export-preparing = Preparing round snapshot
admin-logs-export-downloading = Receiving logs
admin-logs-export-choose-file = Choose a new .jsonl file
admin-logs-export-saving = Saving local file
admin-logs-export-saved = Complete file saved.
admin-logs-export-saved-file = Complete file saved: { $file }
admin-logs-export-cancelled = Export cancelled.
admin-logs-export-progress = { $status } · round { $round } · { $mib } MiB · events: { $logs }
admin-logs-export-round-status = { $status } · round { $round }
admin-logs-export-error-permission = Export requires administrator permissions and log access.
admin-logs-export-error-invalid-round = The selected round was not found or is unavailable.
admin-logs-export-error-confirmation = The confirmation expired or is invalid. Start again.
admin-logs-export-error-busy = An export is already running. Try again after it finishes.
admin-logs-export-error-cooldown = Please wait briefly between exports and try again later.
admin-logs-export-error-timeout = The operation timed out. Export cancelled.
admin-logs-export-error-sequence = Invalid chunk order or size. The incomplete file will not be saved.
admin-logs-export-error-cancelled = The server cancelled the export.
admin-logs-export-error-read = Could not read logs. Export cancelled.
admin-logs-export-error-record-too-large = A log record exceeds the allowed size. The file was not saved.
admin-logs-export-error-too-large = This round exceeds the export limit of 512 MiB or 5 million events. The incomplete file was not saved.
admin-logs-export-error-incomplete = File size or record count differs from the server metadata. The incomplete file was not saved.
admin-logs-export-error-cache-expired = Pending records changed before the snapshot could be created. Try the export again.
admin-logs-export-error-exists = The selected file already exists and was left unchanged. Start the export again and choose a new name.
admin-logs-export-error-local-io = Could not save the local file. The incomplete export was not published as a completed file.
admin-logs-export-error-open-folder = The file is saved, but the exports folder could not be opened.
admin-logs-export-error-cleanup = Could not remove the temporary export file. It may contain sensitive information in the admin-log-exports folder in client user data.
